  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24241e5b3ff7c227",
      "translationZh": "随着上下文增长，KVarN K4/V4 为驻留专家留出了更多内存，并且在该模型架构上运行极佳，RMS 误差较低。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "434e835a7bb4d1e2",
      "translationZh": "良好的默认设置，例如当所有专家无法容纳时，会自动进行 SSD 流式传输和 Cache-Prior，设置通常遵循相同的规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d0c07ea91967e87",
      "translationZh": "这是第三次迭代，我有了更多具体的想法去探索，既是为了从 Apple Silicon 中榨取更多性能，也是为了将引擎带到 Linux 和 AMD 机器（如 Strix Halo）上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9db8056fd19314c7",
      "translationZh": "通过 Homebrew 进行安装，即 \"brew install steadfastgaze/tap/moespresso\"",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "425f7452fe0d269a",
      "translationZh": "代码 - https://github.com/steadfastgaze/MoEspresso 模型 - https://huggingface.co/steadfastgaze/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MoEspressoV3",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "490d864fd9096ec0",
      "translationZh": "如果你尝试了，我很想看看你的 \"moespresso speed\" 输出结果（这是一个刻意设计的快速基准测试）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83fe9c4321cc6fab",
      "translationZh": "注：英语不是我的母语，我使用了 LLM 来帮助润色这篇文章，并使用 AI 编程工具进行实现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fec4a03452a1be76",
      "translationZh": "编辑：一些评论报告了较低的速度（感谢大家的反馈）——我将在明天及接下来的几天内进行调查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
